      "content": "the problem is that \"resting\" doesnt actually change anything. i wake up and the debt is still there, the pressure is still there, the feeling of being a failure is still there. it's just a temporary pause before i have to start running again. it's like... what's even the point of pausing if the destination is just more of the same misery?",
